                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} n
          %p
            It immediately follows (even constructively) that if
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi V
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} V
            has a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/self-mapping"} self-mapping
            with no fixed point (such a map is sometimes called a
            = succeed ")," do
              %em derangement
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
