                %mrow
                  %mi S
                  %mo →
                  %mi V
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} S \to V
            can be a surjection. In fact, we have something slightly stronger than (but classically equivalent to) the failure of
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
