                  %mrow
                    %mi n
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} n
              has no fixed point, apply Theorem
              = succeed "." do
                %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#lawvere"}
          %p
            Note that although negation doesn't have all of its usual properties in constructive mathematics,
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
