          %p
            Of course, Cantor also proved Theorem
            = succeed "," do
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#taylor"}
          %p
            We can combine Theorems
            %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#cantor"}
            and
            %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#taylor"}
            into the following even more general statement, taken from D4.1.8 of Johnstone's
            = succeed "." do
